2026-07-27T11:40:58.1112009Z i /tmp/Rtmpo36Hfe/duckdb
2026-07-27T11:40:58.1112430Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T11:40:58.1112920Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T11:40:58.1113636Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T11:40:58.1114344Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T11:40:58.1115403Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T11:40:58.1116318Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
